<h2><%= @transfer.to_user.email %> accepted the transfer of <%= @app.name %></h2>

<p>Ownership of <strong><%= @app.name %></strong> has moved. From <%= @transfer.accepted_at.strftime("%b %-d, %Y at %H:%M") %> onwards, hourly billing for this app will hit their account, not yours. Historical usage up to that timestamp stays billed to you.</p>
